               紧随一句 **「(These matters are discussed further in 13.5.3.)」**；
               **pp. 152--153, (10.2.1)--(10.2.3)**：G_P = n tr(lambda_1...lambda_6)、G_N = eta tr(...)、G_T = tr(l1l2l3l4)tr(l5l6)，
               **eta = -1 for SO(n), +1 for USp(n), 0 for U(n)**；U(n) 另因超对称被排除；
               **★ p. 165, (10.2.36)(10.2.37)**：W_N = eta(32/n)W_P，W = W_P + W_N，逐字
               **「which vanishes for the gauge group SO(32) and for no other group.」**；同页给出 32 的世界面来历：
               **「The number of such diagrams is equal to the number of ways in which an odd number of twists can be
               distributed on the internal legs of a hexagon diagram, which is 32.」**；
               **pp. 165--167, 10.2.3**：非平面图无反常 + 闭弦 B_{mu nu} 交换树图反常，**两处逐字前向引用 13.5.3**
               给出 B 的两个顶点形式；**pp. 167--168, 10.3**：引力/混合反常、type IIB、杂化弦**在弦论侧全部只有 "suggests"，没有计算**；
               **p. 171, 10.4.2**：(10.4.10) 的发散抵消，作者逐字自评 **「not entirely rigorous」**、
               **「supports the belief that the infinity cancellation argument could be made rigorous」**；
               **pp. 172--173, 10.5 Summary** 逐字「The requirement that these anomalies cancel **uniquely determines**
               the gauge group to be SO(32).」
               **★ 三条硬性使用限制**：
               (1) **第 10 章的 "iff SO(32)" 只覆盖「type I、单圈、纯规范六边形、Chan--Paton 群 SO(n)/USp(n)/U(n)」**，
