             其推导链**全部带编号且全在公理体系内**：**(2.36) Jacobi identity（顶点代数公理）** => **(2.38) commutator formula
             `[psi_m, phi_n] = sum_{i>=0} C(m,i)(psi_i phi)_{m+n-i}`**（正文逐字：(2.37)/(2.38) 是 (2.36) 的 m=0 与 l=0 特例）
             => **(2.41) `[L_(n), Y(phi,z)] = sum_{i>=-1} C(n+1,i+1) Y(L_(i)phi, z) z^{n-i}`**（逐字「Taking Res_{z_0}[Res_{z_1}[z_1^n (Jacobi identity)]] in the special case psi = omega」）
             => (2.56)/(2.57)。另 **(2.32) Regularity 公理 `psi_n phi = 0` for n sufficiently large**（p.579）。
             **§3.1, p. 593, eq. (3.2)-(3.3)**：**transversal DDF operator 定义为零模** `A^xi_m := (xi(-1)e^{mk})_0 = Res_z[Y(xi(-1)e^{mk},z)] = Res_z[xi(z)Y(e^{mk},z)]`，
             逐字「where normal ordering in the last line is unnecessary due to **xi.k = 0**」；前置 (3.1) 给物理态的李括号。
             **§3.1, p. 594, eq. (3.4)** `[A^xi_m, A^eta_n] = m(xi.eta) delta_{m+n,0}(k(-1))_0 = m(xi.eta) delta_{m+n,0} k(0)`
             ——**★ 右端显式保留 k(0) = k.alpha_0**，同页逐字说明只有在 `k.r = 1` 时才「realize precisely the algebra of d-2 transversal oscillators」。
