             (3.29) `[L-frak_m, L-frak_n] = (m-n)L-frak_{m+n} + 2(m^3-m)delta_{m+n,0}k(0)`，逐字「central charge c_L = 24 … **universal** in the sense that
             its central charge **does not depend on the dimension of the lattice**」；(3.31) `[L-frak_m, A^xi_n] = -n A^xi_{n+m}`；
             (3.42) `script-L_n := (1/2) sum_i sum_m :A^i_m A^i_{n-m}:`（c = d-2）；(3.43) `[script-L_m, A^i_n] = -n A^i_{n+m}`；
             (3.44) `A^-_n := L-frak_n - script-L_n`；(3.45) `[A^i_m, A^-_n] = 0`；
             (3.46) `[A^-_m, A^-_n] = (m-n)A^-_{m+n} + ((26-d)/12)(m^3-m)delta_{m+n,0}`；
             **(3.48) `P_(1)(r) = S(t-hat^-) tensor V(26-d, 0)`**——无鬼定理的**张量积分解**形式（横向 Fock (x) Virasoro Verma），
             与 lian-zuckerman-1991 Theorem 3.5(i) 同构。**常设假设 `r.k = 1` 写在 (3.29) 之前，引用必带。**
             §3.2 末 p.599 逐字：「we can always find d-2 **orthonormal** vectors xi_i, 1 <= i <= d-2, **orthogonal to both r and k**」
